He said that to carry forward the great spirit of the Long March and make steady progress on the new Long March, it is imperative to:
-- stay committed to the Party's ideals, convictions and fundamental purpose, fully implement the Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, remain true to the Party's original aspiration and founding mission, and rely closely on the people to create new historic achievements;
-- unswervingly advance high-quality development, continuously meet the people's ever-growing needs for a better life, ensure coordinated implementation of the Five-Sphere Integrated Plan and the Four-Pronged Comprehensive Strategy, promote higher-quality economic growth while achieving an appropriate increase in economic output, and advance common {{19}} for all;
-- have the courage to carry out a great struggle with many new historical features, better ensure both development and security, and seize the historical initiative to overcome difficulties, combat risks and meet challenges, so as to ensure that the giant ship of national rejuvenation cuts through the waves and sails steadily forward;
-- accelerate reinforcing the people's armed forces to world-class standards, always uphold the Party's absolute leadership over the army, realize the goals for the centenary of the People's Liberation Army on schedule, and advance national defense and military modernization with high quality;
-- uphold Party leadership, strengthen Party building, persevere with full and rigorous Party self-governance, and consistently advance its efforts to purify, improve, renew, and excel itself, ensuring that the Party serves as the strong leadership core in building socialism with Chinese characteristics. While presiding over the event, Zhao Leji said Xi's important speech reviewed the great course of the Red Army's Long March led by the Party, summarized the great significance of the victory of the Long March, revealed the key to victory that has enabled the Party and the people's army to march forward resolutely, expounded the historical value of the great Long March spirit, and set out clear requirements for carrying forward the great Long March spirit and succeeding in the new Long March. Xi's speech was of immense political, ideological and guiding significance, Zhao said, urging earnest efforts to study and grasp its essence and ensure its effective implementation. He called on the whole Party, the entire military and the Chinese people of all ethnic groups to rally more closely around the Party Central Committee with Xi at its core, follow the guidance of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era, gain a profound understanding of the decisive significance of the "Two Affirmations," strengthen the "Four Consciousnesses," bolster the "Four Confidences," and ensure the "Two Upholds." He urged efforts to carry forward the great spirit of the Long March, succeed in the new Long March, and strive to build a great country and advance national rejuvenation on all fronts through Chinese modernization. The assembly concluded to the powerful strains of The Internationale.
